      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Nested Class Summary",
      "translation": "嵌套类摘要",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Utilities to generate JSON Schemas from Java types and method signatures. It's designed\nto work well in the context of tool calling and structured outputs, aiming at ensuring\nconsistency and robustness across different model providers.",
      "translation": "用于从 Java 类型和方法签名生成 JSON Schema 的工具。该工具专为工具调用和结构化输出场景设计，旨在确保在不同模型提供商之间的一致性和鲁棒性。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<ul>\n<li><code>@ToolParam(required = ..., description = ...)</code></li>\n<li><code>@JsonProperty(required = ...)</code></li>\n<li><code>@JsonClassDescription(...)</code></li>\n<li><code>@JsonPropertyDescription(...)</code></li>\n<li><code>@Schema(required = ..., description = ...)</code></li>\n<li><code>@Nullable</code></li>\n</ul>",
      "translation": "<ul>\n<li><code>@ToolParam(required = ..., description = ...)</code></li>\n<li><code>@JsonProperty(required = ...)</code></li>\n<li><code>@JsonClassDescription(...)</code></li>\n<li><code>@JsonPropertyDescription(...)</code></li>\n<li><code>@Schema(required = ..., description = ...)</code></li>\n<li><code>@Nullable</code></li>\n</ul>",
      "count": 1
